/** @defgroup effects_processing Effects Processing
 *  @brief Audio effect modules for MidiSynth output and SoundFont voice processing.
 *
 *  @details
 *  Maestro MPTK provides two complementary effect families:
 *  - @ref soundfont_effects: per-voice SoundFont/FluidSynth-based effects.
 *  - @ref unity_effects: whole-player Unity AudioSource effects.
 */

/** @defgroup soundfont_effects SoundFont Effects
 *  @ingroup effects_processing
 *  @brief Per-voice effects derived from SoundFont/FluidSynth processing.
 *
 *  @details
 *  These effects are evaluated per voice and follow SoundFont behavior, with MPTK
 *  runtime offsets and controls for filter/reverb/chorus parameters.
 */

/** @defgroup unity_effects Unity Effects
 *  @ingroup effects_processing
 *  @brief Whole-player Unity AudioSource effects (Reverb and Chorus).
 *
 *  @details
 *  These effects apply at the AudioSource level and affect the full player output.
 */

/** @page sound_effects_workflow Add Sound Effects
 *  @brief Choose and configure SoundFont effects or Unity effects in Maestro MPTK.
 *
 *  @details
 *  Two effect paths are available:
 *  - <b>SoundFont effects</b>: per-voice processing, based on FluidSynth modules.
 *  - <b>Unity effects</b>: player-wide effects on the AudioSource output.
 *
 *  @section fx_choose Choose the Effect Path
 *  - Use @ref soundfont_effects when you need per-voice SoundFont-style behavior.
 *  - Use @ref unity_effects when you want global output shaping on the whole player.
 *
 *  @section fx_soundfont SoundFont Effects Workflow
 *  1. Enable SoundFont effects on @ref MidiPlayerTK.MPTKEffectSoundFont "MPTK_EffectSoundFont".
 *  2. Configure filter/reverb/chorus offsets and defaults.
 *  3. Validate CPU impact because these effects run per voice.
 *
 *  @section fx_unity Unity Effects Workflow
 *  1. Enable effects on @ref MidiPlayerTK.MPTKEffectUnity "MPTK_EffectUnity".
 *  2. Configure Reverb and Chorus parameters.
 *  3. Tune values in context of the full mix.
 *
 *  @section fx_api Related API
 *  - @ref soundfont_effects
 *  - @ref unity_effects
 *  - @ref effects_processing
 *  - @ref synth_engine
 *  - @ref maestro_pro_features
 *
 *  @see MidiPlayerTK.MPTKEffectSoundFont
 *  @see MidiPlayerTK.MPTKEffectUnity
 */
